Package: knits
Version: __VERSION__
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: __SIZE__
Depends: python3 (>= 3.7)
Recommends: chromium | chromium-browser | google-chrome-stable | firefox
Maintainer: Knits <knits@localhost>
Homepage: https://github.com/snimmagadda2-alt/Knits
Description: macOS-style desktop environment for Debian-based devices
 Knits is a self-contained desktop experience that looks and behaves like
 macOS: a menu bar, a dock, draggable windows, Finder, Terminal, Notes,
 Calculator and System Settings.
 .
 It runs as a local web app. The knits command serves the bundled files on
 127.0.0.1 and opens them in an app window, so nothing is uploaded and no
 network connection is required.
